    { "key": "help.body", "value": "NEXUS OS 4.1 -- QUICK HELP\n\nOPEN: Double-click an icon or file to open it.\nMOVE A WINDOW: Drag it by its title bar.\nMOVE FILES: Drag a file onto a folder to move it there.\nSHRED: Drag a file onto the Disposal bin, then confirm.\nOPTIONS: Right-click an item to see what you can do with it.\nHELP: Double-click NEXUS Help on the desktop, or open it from the Nexus menu.\n\nNEXUS OS records all activity for quality purposes." },
